# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the two PUBLIC values
# from your Supabase project: Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
#
# These are safe to expose in the client bundle — the anon/publishable key is
# designed to be public, and Row-Level Security (see supabase/migrations) is what
# actually protects the data. Leaving them blank simply runs the app fully
# offline on localStorage.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key, DB password, or a personal access token here or
# anywhere in the repo. Those stay in your shell / the Supabase dashboard only.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
